Count Even and Odd Numbers

Exercise:
Given an array of integers, count how many numbers are even and how many are odd.

Example:

Input:  [2, 7, 4, 9, 10, 13]

Output:
Even: 3
Odd: 3


Solution:


const num = [3, 7, 2, 9, 4];
let even = 0;
let odd = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < num.length; i++) {
  if (num[i] % 2 === 1) {
    odd += 1;
  } else {
    even += 1;
  }
}
